# Nerupa's Request (Q160): an elven fighter of level 10 accepts at Nerupa with the silvery
# spidersilk, which Unoren, Creamees and Julia trade along for the nightshade leaf; Unoren and
# Creamees have their own lines once it is carried, and Nerupa takes the leaf for lesser healing
# potions and experience; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q160_nerupas_request.golden
character Courier 10
class 18
script quest.Q160_NerupasRequest
item 1026 1027 1028 1029 1060
